  description: Older than the kingdom, older than its name. It does not want worship
    back. It wants the silence it had before you.
  tactics: The first d10. Dense rings and storm crosses, then rift crosses with walls
    and homing while Cinderlings pour in, then EVERYTHING while Reavers hunt you.
    Kill the adds in the breach windows or drown.
